</svg></div>[/et_pb_code][/et_pb_column][et_pb_column type="1_2" _builder_version="4.27.4" custom_padding="|||" custom_padding__hover="|||" global_colors_info="{}"][et_pb_text _builder_version="4.27.4" global_colors_info="{}"]<p class="phx-eyebrow"><span class="num">03</span> Plant &amp; capability</p><h2>Our own rigs. Our own crews.</h2><p>Phoenix runs its fleet in-house rather than subcontracting it out. That is not a boast about kit &mdash; it is the reason we can commit to a start date and hold it, put the right rig on the right hole rather than the one that happens to be free, and keep the same crew on your site from set-up to demobilisation.</p>[/et_pb_text][et_pb_code _builder_version="4.27.4" global_colors_info="{}"]<ul class="phx-spec"><li><b>Cable percussive</b><span>Dando 4000, 2000 &amp; 150, Edeco-Pilcon 2000</span></li><li><b>Rotary</b><span>Open hole, conventional and triple-tube coring</span></li><li><b>Flush media</b><span>Air, water, polymer and mud</span></li><li><b>Sampling</b><span>Window sampling, trial pitting, SPT, U100</span></li><li><b>Access</b><span>Tracked and restricted-access rigs for tight plots</span></li><li><b>Over water</b><span>Nearshore drilling from floating plant</span></li><li><b>Installations</b><span>Standpipes, monitoring wells, geothermal loops, headworks</span></li></ul>[/et_pb_code][/et_pb_column][/et_pb_row][/et_pb_section][et_pb_section fb_built="1" _builder_version="4.27.4" background_color="#16191c" custom_padding="110px||110px||true|false" module_class="phx phx-sectors" global_colors_info="{}"][et_pb_row column_structure="4_4" _builder_version="4.27.4" width="100%" max_width="1280px" custom_padding="0px||70px||false|false" module_class="phx-row" global_colors_info="{}"][et_pb_column type="4_4" _builder_version="4.27.4" custom_padding="|||" custom_padding__hover="|||" global_colors_info="{}"][et_pb_text _builder_version="4.27.4" global_colors_info="{}"]<p class="phx-eyebrow"><span class="num">04</span> Sectors</p><h2>Who we drill for.</h2><p class="phx-lede">Most of our work comes through geotechnical consultants and main contractors, but the rig does not care who is paying &mdash; only that the hole is right.</p>[/et_pb_text][/et_pb_column][/et_pb_row][et_pb_row column_structure="1_3,1_3,1_3" _builder_version="4.27.4" width="100%" max_width="1280px" custom_padding="0px||0px||false|false" module_class="phx-row" global_colors_info="{}"][et_pb_column type="1_3" _builder_version="4.27.4" custom_padding="|||" custom_padding__hover="|||" global_colors_info="{}"][et_pb_code _builder_version="4.27.4" global_colors_info="{}"]<div class="phx-sector"><svg class="phx-ico" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#phx-crane"/></svg><div><h3>Construction &amp; Civils</h3><p>Site investigation for foundation design, earthworks and remediation, from single plots to major schemes.</p></div></div>[/et_pb_code][/et_pb_column][et_pb_column type="1_3" _builder_version="4.27.4" custom_padding="|||" custom_padding__hover="|||" global_colors_info="{}"][et_pb_code _builder_version="4.27.4" global_colors_info="{}"]<div class="phx-sector"><svg class="phx-ico" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#phx-turbine"/></svg><div><h3>Renewable Energy</h3><p>Turbine base and cable route investigation, plus geothermal boreholes for heat pump schemes.</p></div></div>[/et_pb_code][/et_pb_column][et_pb_column type="1_3" _builder_version="4.27.4" custom_padding="|||" custom_padding__hover="|||" global_colors_info="{}"][et_pb_code _builder_version="4.27.4" global_colors_info="{}"]<div class="phx-sector"><svg class="phx-ico" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#phx-drop"/></svg><div><h3>Water Supply</h3><p>Private supply for farms, estates, distilleries, golf courses and industrial process water.</p></div></div>[/et_pb_code][/et_pb_column][/et_pb_row][et_pb_row column_structure="1_3,1_3,1_3" _builder_version="4.27.4" width="100%" max_width="1280px" custom_padding="0px||0px||false|false" module_class="phx-row" global_colors_info="{}"][et_pb_column type="1_3" _builder_version="4.27.4" custom_padding="|||" custom_padding__hover="|||" global_colors_info="{}"][et_pb_code _builder_version="4.27.4" global_colors_info="{}"]<div class="phx-sector"><svg class="phx-ico" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#phx-quarry"/></svg><div><h3>Mining &amp; Quarrying</h3><p>Mineral investigation, quarry development, disused workings, shaft location and de-watering.</p></div></div>[/et_pb_code][/et_pb_column][et_pb_column type="1_3" _builder_version="4.27.4" custom_padding="|||" custom_padding__hover="|||" global_colors_info="{}"][et_pb_code _builder_version="4.27.4" global_colors_info="{}"]<div class="phx-sector"><svg class="phx-ico" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#phx-flask"/></svg><div><h3>Environmental Consultancy</h3><p>Geoenvironmental sampling, gas and groundwater monitoring installations, long-term monitoring rounds.</p></div></div>[/et_pb_code][/et_pb_column][et_pb_column type="1_3" _builder_version="4.27.4" custom_padding="|||" custom_padding__hover="|||" global_colors_info="{}"][et_pb_code _builder_version="4.27.4" global_colors_info="{}"]<div class="phx-sector"><svg class="phx-ico" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#phx-bridge"/></svg><div><h3>Infrastructure</h3><p>Road, rail, bridge and utility corridors, including restricted-access and over-water positions.</p></div></div>[/et_pb_code][/et_pb_column][/et_pb_row][/et_pb_section][et_pb_section fb_built="1" _builder_version="4.27.4" background_color="#eceef0" custom_padding="110px||110px||true|false" module_class="phx phx--light phx-process" global_colors_info="{}"][et_pb_row column_structure="4_4" _builder_version="4.27.4" width="100%" max_width="1280px" custom_padding="0px||70px||false|false" module_class="phx-row" global_colors_info="{}"][et_pb_column type="4_4" _builder_version="4.27.4" custom_padding="|||" custom_padding__hover="|||" global_colors_info="{}"][et_pb_text _builder_version="4.27.4" global_colors_info="{}"]<p class="phx-eyebrow"><span class="num">05</span> How we work</p><h2>Five steps, and no surprises in the middle of them.</h2>[/et_pb_text][/et_pb_column][/et_pb_row][et_pb_row column_structure="1_5,1_5,1_5,1_5,1_5" _builder_version="4.27.4" width="100%" max_width="1280px" custom_padding="0px||0px||false|false" module_class="phx-row" global_colors_info="{}"][et_pb_column type="1_5" _builder_version="4.27.4" custom_padding="|||" custom_padding__hover="|||" global_colors_info="{}"][et_pb_code _builder_version="4.27.4" global_colors_info="{}"]<div class="phx-step"><b>01</b><h3>Enquiry &amp; scope</h3><p>You send the specification, or a sketch and a postcode. We come back with method, duration and price.</p></div>[/et_pb_code][/et_pb_column][et_pb_column type="1_5" _builder_version="4.27.4" custom_padding="|||" custom_padding__hover="|||" global_colors_info="{}"][et_pb_code _builder_version="4.27.4" global_colors_info="{}"]<div class="phx-step"><b>02</b><h3>Desk study &amp; permits</h3><p>Services search, access review, and the consents the site needs before a rig turns a wheel.</p></div>[/et_pb_code][/et_pb_column][et_pb_column type="1_5" _builder_version="4.27.4" custom_padding="|||" custom_padding__hover="|||" global_colors_info="{}"][et_pb_code _builder_version="4.27.4" global_colors_info="{}"]<div class="phx-step"><b>03</b><h3>Mobilisation</h3><p>RAMS issued and agreed, plant and crew allocated, set-up on an agreed date rather than a hopeful one.</p></div>[/et_pb_code][/et_pb_column][et_pb_column type="1_5" _builder_version="4.27.4" custom_padding="|||" custom_padding__hover="|||" global_colors_info="{}"][et_pb_code _builder_version="4.27.4" global_colors_info="{}"]<div class="phx-step"><b>04</b><h3>Drilling &amp; sampling</h3><p>Holes advanced, samples taken and protected, installations placed, daily records kept as we go.</p></div>[/et_pb_code][/et_pb_column][et_pb_column type="1_5" _builder_version="4.27.4" custom_padding="|||" custom_padding__hover="|||" global_colors_info="{}"][et_pb_code _builder_version="4.27.4" global_colors_info="{}"]<div class="phx-step"><b>05</b><h3>Records &amp; handover</h3><p>Driller's logs, installation details and photographs issued in the format your engineer works in.</p></div>[/et_pb_code][/et_pb_column][/et_pb_row][/et_pb_section][et_pb_section fb_built="1" _builder_version="4.27.4" background_color="#0e1113" custom_padding="110px||110px||true|false" module_class="phx phx--deep phx-projects phx-equal" global_colors_info="{}"][et_pb_row column_structure="4_4" _builder_version="4.27.4" width="100%" max_width="1280px" custom_padding="0px||70px||false|false" module_class="phx-row" global_colors_info="{}"][et_pb_column type="4_4" _builder_version="4.27.4" custom_padding="|||" custom_padding__hover="|||" global_colors_info="{}"][et_pb_text _builder_version="4.27.4" global_colors_info="{}"]<p class="phx-eyebrow"><span class="num">06</span> Selected work</p><h2>Representative projects.</h2><p class="phx-lede">A cross-section of the work: a brownfield investigation over old workings, a private water supply, and a closed-loop array under a new building.</p>[/et_pb_text][/et_pb_column][/et_pb_row][et_pb_row column_structure="1_3,1_3,1_3" _builder_version="4.27.4" width="100%" max_width="1280px" custom_padding="0px||0px||false|false" module_class="phx-row" global_colors_info="{}"][et_pb_column type="1_3" _builder_version="4.27.4" custom_padding="|||" custom_padding__hover="|||" global_colors_info="{}"][et_pb_code _builder_version="4.27.4" global_colors_info="{}"]<div class="phx-project"><div class="phx-project__media"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 800 600" role="img" aria-label="Rock core recovered into core boxes and logged on site">
