</svg><span class="phx-project__tag">Ground investigation</span></div><div class="phx-project__body"><h3>Brownfield site over historic workings</h3><p class="phx-project__meta"><span>Central Belt</span><span>Residential</span></p><p>Cable percussion through made ground and till, then triple-tube coring to prove the condition of shallow coal workings beneath the development footprint. Gas and groundwater monitoring wells left in place for the consultant's monitoring rounds.</p></div></div>[/et_pb_code][/et_pb_column][et_pb_column type="1_3" _builder_version="4.27.4" custom_padding="|||" custom_padding__hover="|||" global_colors_info="{}"][et_pb_code _builder_version="4.27.4" global_colors_info="{}"]<div class="phx-project"><div class="phx-project__media"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 800 600" role="img" aria-label="A completed water supply borehole headworks with casing, pump and rising main below the water table">
