</svg><span class="phx-project__tag">Water supply</span></div><div class="phx-project__body"><h3>Private supply borehole for a rural estate</h3><p class="phx-project__meta"><span>Highlands</span><span>Agricultural</span></p><p>Sited, drilled and cased into a bedrock aquifer to take the property off a failing spring supply. Screened, developed and test pumped, with headworks and rising main installed ready for the treatment kit.</p></div></div>[/et_pb_code][/et_pb_column][et_pb_column type="1_3" _builder_version="4.27.4" custom_padding="|||" custom_padding__hover="|||" global_colors_info="{}"][et_pb_code _builder_version="4.27.4" global_colors_info="{}"]<div class="phx-project"><div class="phx-project__media"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 800 600" role="img" aria-label="A closed-loop ground source heat pump array of vertical boreholes connected to a manifold and plant room">
