</svg><span class="phx-project__tag">Geothermal</span></div><div class="phx-project__body"><h3>Closed-loop array for a new-build scheme</h3><p class="phx-project__meta"><span>East of Scotland</span><span>Commercial</span></p><p>A grid of vertical boreholes drilled, loops installed and grouted, then headed up to a manifold for the incoming heat pump plant — sequenced around the main contractor's groundworks programme.</p></div></div>[/et_pb_code][/et_pb_column][/et_pb_row][/et_pb_section][et_pb_section fb_built="1" _builder_version="4.27.4" background_color="#16191c" custom_padding="110px||110px||true|false" module_class="phx phx-coverage" global_colors_info="{}"][et_pb_row column_structure="4_4" _builder_version="4.27.4" width="100%" max_width="1280px" custom_padding="0px||70px||false|false" module_class="phx-row" global_colors_info="{}"][et_pb_column type="4_4" _builder_version="4.27.4" custom_padding="|||" custom_padding__hover="|||" global_colors_info="{}"][et_pb_text _builder_version="4.27.4" global_colors_info="{}"]<p class="phx-eyebrow"><span class="num">07</span> Where we work</p><h2>Livingston at the centre of it.</h2><p class="phx-lede">Our head office and yard sit in West Lothian, halfway between Edinburgh and Glasgow and inside an hour of most of the Central Belt. Offices in Inverness and Aberdeen cover the north and north-east, and we mobilise UK-wide.</p>[/et_pb_text][/et_pb_column][/et_pb_row][et_pb_row column_structure="1_2,1_2" _builder_version="4.27.4" width="100%" max_width="1280px" custom_padding="0px||0px||false|false" module_class="phx-row" global_colors_info="{}"][et_pb_column type="1_2" _builder_version="4.27.4" custom_padding="|||" custom_padding__hover="|||" global_colors_info="{}"][et_pb_code _builder_version="4.27.4" global_colors_info="{}"]<div class="phx-figure"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 520 640" role="img" aria-label="A stylised map of Scotland marking the Livingston head office and the Inverness and Aberdeen 